  "description": "Generates the AeroSignalR spec document from the SignalR hubs mapped in an ASP.NET Core app: invocations, Hub<T> callbacks, streaming, nullability, XML doc summaries, and bearer auth metadata, discovered by reflection with zero attributes. Serves it from an endpoint (MapSignalRSpec), renders a human-readable viewer (MapSignalRSpecUI), and exports it headlessly (TryExportSignalRSpecAsync) without starting Kestrel, so client generation never needs a running server.",
